OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CToday:FRain will spread northeast      
OL,6,Fduring this morning. Then this         
OL,7,Fafternoon will be cloudy with rain,    
OL,8,Fbut drier weather extending northeast  
OL,9,Facross all parts by late afternoon.    
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be mostly   
OL,12,Fdry and cold with clear periods. Then  
OL,13,Fmainly dry for the rest of the night   
OL,14,Fbut showery rain will spread east      
OL,15,Flater.                                 
OL,17,CSunday:FCloudy start with some showery 
OL,18,Frain. Then becoming brighter and       
OL,19,Fmainly dry with the odd shower in the  
OL,20,Fnorth and west.                        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
