OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:       
OL,6,FCloudy, mild and windy on Monday with  
OL,7,Frain at times. Early rain on Tuesday   
OL,8,Fthen bright with the odd shower.       
OL,9,FBright with a few showers on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
